# Hual04a diagnostic route (item86 re-time on the integrated engine-fidelity tree):
# six kills, earned card, bureau reader. The automatic AI bursts (`Pawn.PressingFire`
# reads the controller bFire byte) tripled the incoming damage, so the route now fights
# each soldier from before it closes, crouches while under the charged soldier's burst
# and heals on the base medkit. The route is cut at the bureau card reader: picking the
# fuse (`FusibleRamasse`) spawns the `Cine1` `LastWave` reinforcement (tabActions[35])
# whose burst kills the 17-hp player on the walk-out (measured), so the fuse goals, lever
# and Hual04c travel are not attempted.
# Diagnostic weapon grant: Beretta carried from Hual01b through Hual02 (see
# hual02_route.script's campaign-loadout note). Direct Hual04a login has no Beretta.
# No teleports, set_goal or take_control. Coordinates and times are Unreal units/seconds.
# The engine's `AActor::IsOverlapping` tests a VolumeBrush with its brush primitive, so
# DetectionVolume4 (`Degage`) and DetectionVolume5 (`dernierpoint`) fire on the walked
# route and Carrington's `Cine1.Play(2)` starts. The alerted canyon soldiers now converge,
# so the six-soldier death-event chain is completed by input (all six dead); do not infer
# the card counter from Timer.
t=0.50 weapon xiii.Beretta
t=1.00 switch_weapon 2
t=2.50 goto -10200 -1500
t=6.00 goto -9600 -1600
t=10.00 goto -9042 -2286
t=14.00 goto -8582 -2333
t=18.00 goto -8058 -2049
t=22.00 goto -7433 -1524
t=26.00 goto -6741 -1012
t=30.00 goto -6432 320
t=34.00 goto -6172 -533
t=38.00 goto -5625 4
t=42.00 goto -5522 462
t=46.00 goto -5105 1301
t=50.00 goto -4474 2524
t=54.00 goto -3645 1693
t=58.00 goto -3302 1388
t=62.00 goto -3203 1209
t=66.00 goto -3140 300
t=70.00 goto -3160 -600
# Fight the two canyon soldiers from the (-3160,-600) stop, before their burst
# fire ramps up; the rifleman (BaseSoldier1) dies before it charges out of weapon
# range, then the shotgun soldier after a reload.
t=72.00 track BaseSoldier1 0.85
t=72.20 fire
t=72.60 fire
t=73.00 fire
t=73.40 fire
t=73.80 fire
t=74.20 fire
t=74.60 fire
